# Claude Code — ~/.claude is a real directory; the tracked files below are linked
# into it one by one (setup/05-symlinks.md). Everything else in it is machine-local
# by default (credentials, session transcripts, per-project memory, caches, logs,
# plugins, hooks with their node_modules, scratch plans); the ! lines below are the
# shared agent config. A new shared file needs its own ! line, and a path that must
# stay on this machine goes under "local again", after the ! that would catch it.
claude/*
!claude/CLAUDE.md
!claude/playbooks/
!claude/playbooks/**
!claude/config.yaml
!claude/settings.json
!claude/statusline.sh
!claude/workflow-templates.yaml
!claude/commands/
!claude/commands/**
!claude/scripts/
!claude/scripts/**
!claude/skills/
!claude/skills/**
!claude/themes/
!claude/themes/**

# local again — inside a shared folder, but this machine's own
claude/settings.local.json
claude/skills/rexa
claude/skills/rexa-tasks
claude/skills/synced
claude/**/node_modules
claude/**/*.local
claude/**/*.backup
claude/**/*.bak.*

core/target
